## 3. Causality Assessment

### WHO-UMC Causality Scale
* Classification: Probable / Likely
* Rationale:
  1. Clear temporal sequence (tendon pain onset on Day 8, progressing to rupture on Day 10 of Levofloxacin therapy).
  2. Positive de-challenge with resolution of contralateral tendinitis following drug withdrawal.
  3. Alternative causes (trauma, high-impact exercise, systemic corticosteroids) were ruled out.

